# REQUIREMENTS: cu-004

CU-004 implements the Delta Lake bronze sink via Spark, replacing LakehouseConnector JSON writes: BronzeSink.write appends each BronzeUnit (raw article data + enrichment metadata) as ONE Delta row partitioned by ingested_date, using an explicit StructType (no implicits encoders). Requires cu-001 (BronzeUnit, BronzeSink). This CU satisfies feat-1 criterion 5 (data + metadata as one unit in bronze).
